<title>USA: Fed says weekend system RPs totaled $3.090 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says weekend system RPs totaled $3.090 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said its over-the-weekend system repurchase operation on Friday totaled $3.090 billion.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1867 ))</p>
